{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1406844-how-does-the-technocracy-new-world-order-condition-enemy-mages","id":1406844,"title":"How does the Technocracy/New World Order Condition enemy Mages?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-08-07T15:26:27-07:00","id":1406844,"title":"How does the Technocracy/New World Order Condition enemy Mages?","content":"And is it possible for Traditions and Crafts to reverse engineer the process and use it for their own ends?<br /> <br /> A pet peeve, but unlike what Hollywood tells you Torture is not a effective way to learn information.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/science/the-lay-scientist/2010/nov/04/2\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/static/sys-images/Guardian/Pix/red/blue_pics/2008/02/11/KHALED3.jpg?width=1200&amp;height=630&amp;quality=85&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;precrop=40:21,offset-x50,offset-y0&amp;overlay-align=bottom%2Cleft&amp;overlay-width=100p&amp;overlay-base64=L2ltZy9zdGF0aWMvb3ZlcmxheXMvdGctYWdlLTIwMTAucG5n&amp;enable=upscale&amp;s=d99642c73fa1cc7f856f6b86a16a0e5b\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/science/the-lay-scientist/2010/nov/04/2\" target=\"_blank\"> Does torture work? </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/science/the-lay-scientist/2010/nov/04/2\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.theguardian.com/science/the-lay-scientist/2010/nov/04/2 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Debates about the ethics of torture are all very well, but does it even work in the first place? </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> (And I know some Magi might think it\u2019s \u201cunethical\u201d to Brainwash people, but come on Free will is a overrated concept. And plus doesn\u2019t Brainwashing sound nice, I mean people like Carwashes,/s/)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-07T15:30:26-07:00","id":1406847,"title":"","content":"I would suggest watching the movie 1984 and Brazil. Both contain a room 101 (1984 coined the term), now add some techno sorcery. Extra credit watch the old BBC series The Prisoner episode &quot;Free for all&quot;.<br /> <br /> Really it's just mind/life magic with tools that conforms to the technocrat paradigm.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3953,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","user":"Dwight","date":". 08-07-2020, 06:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-07T15:57:31-07:00","id":1406850,"title":"","content":"Yeah; it's not really something that needs reverse-engineering. Mages of <i>any</i> stripe can do the same thing. It's just that the Traditions don't have any interest in doing so (less because of \u201cfree will\u201d than because of \u201cdiversity\u201d), and the Disparates are so rare that even if a majority favored such a thing (and they don't), it would still be primarily a Technocracy thing. The real trick involves making the Conditioning permanent. <br /> <br /> What I find more interesting is the related phenomenon that TR calls \u201cterranorming\u201d, or \u201cmoving the Overton Window\u201d: it's basically the same notion as Conditioning, but applied to the Masses.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":421,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","user":"Dataweaver","date":". 08-07-2020, 07:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-08T09:31:13-07:00","id":1406984,"title":"","content":"Torture isn't effective, but an application of Mind 3 might change that. <br /> <br /> The hardest part about reprogramming is making it permenant. After the initial willpower shredding and installation of acceptable ideas, you still have someone capable of trying to resist and undoing all of that hard work. A simple mind 2 Gadget pill that gives &quot;Technocracy good&quot; vibes for the day would help protect that work, but only if they took it. Lots of rewards would also help make it stick. <br /> <br /> If a troublesome orphan mage always wanted a nice house, motor bike, nice teeth, and suddenly had all of that and more, they would be less likely to try and &quot;forget&quot; their meds. <br /> <br /> Traditions could also do this if they wanted to, but it's a lot more work than just promising knowledge and power to people who want it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26088-actual_table","name":"Actual_Table","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26088_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-12T09:18:55-07:00","id":1407711,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1406844-how-does-the-technocracy-new-world-order-condition-enemy-mages?p=1406850#post1406850\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What I find more interesting is the related phenomenon that TR calls \u201cterranorming\u201d, or \u201cmoving the Overton Window\u201d: it's basically the same notion as Conditioning, but applied to the Masses.</div> </div> </div> </div>It sure would be nice to have actual &quot;reality war&quot; mechanics, for sure.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1410-czernobog","name":"Czernobog","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-12T09:27:55-07:00","id":1407713,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Czernobog</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1406844-how-does-the-technocracy-new-world-order-condition-enemy-mages?p=1407711#post1407711\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It sure would be nice to have actual &amp;quot;reality war&amp;quot; mechanics, for sure.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think somewhere in that bloated tome of a book are some rules for reality zones.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-12T09:36:11-07:00","id":1407716,"title":"","content":"They boil down to \u201cchanging a Reality Zone can't be done by Magick; here are some real-world propaganda techniques to use instead.\u201d","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-18T08:44:42-07:00","id":1408936,"title":"","content":"Also, remember that the idea behind the Technocracy's Science is that anyone can do it. Sure, Hyperscience is more advanced than regular people can do, but unlike so many of the Tradition's paradigms you don't need to &quot;know yourself&quot; to use it. The Technocracy can steal away your identity and your Will and you can still use their practices. That doesn't work so well in the other direction.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: The Ice-ension: An Epic Game of Reality on the Rink","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/758-ramnesis","name":"Ramnesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-18T10:32:10-07:00","id":1408969,"title":"","content":"There is a real interesting scene in the film &quot;Genocidal Organ&quot; where the protagonist is talking to a therapist before going on a mission. The wall behind the therapist shows a yellow butterfly flying around in a pattern while he asks some questions and then finishes up the briefing saying &quot;Now your ready to go shoot some kids.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-18T18:54:48-07:00","id":1409047,"title":"","content":"I think the tecnocracy doesn't need torture to &quot;brainwash&quot; someone. Techniques of coercion, active interrogation and blackmail with some &quot;enlightened psychology&quot; (Mind Sphere) will easily do the work and even generates a kind of &quot;Stockholm syndrome&quot; depending on how long the victim has been kidnapped - it is as better to convince one to cooperate &quot;spontaneously&quot; than enforce the cooperation by torture and risk being betrayed. By the way, they could use microchips, microwaves and even &quot;electroconvulsive therapy&quot;. But, of course, a mage with powerful rotes of mind (optional entropy) can reverse and use this in them favor. However, the NWO is even more dangerous as they can use massive propaganda and &quot;meme thing&quot; (with Entropy) to do some large-scale brainwashing into a society and not only sleepers will be affected, mages and other supernatural creatures can succumb too.<br /> <br /> About &quot;traditions doing brainwash&quot;, probably Hermetic order use it guarantee their dominance over enemies - whether they are magicians or other supernatural creatures. Moreover, I can readly think of a hollow one using mind sphere to brainwash some regular tradition members, other &quot;hollows&quot; or even other supernatural being - like a captured vampire (ordinarily caitiffs or independents) or maybe ratkins[?] - to use as a personal bodyguard.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26367-wickedone","name":"WickedOne","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26367_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-18T20:32:44-07:00","id":1409067,"title":"","content":"Have you seen the Star Trek Next Generation episode &quot;Chain of Command&quot;? It's certainly torture but not the crude rubber hose variety.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-19T07:58:01-07:00","id":1409137,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WickedOne</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1406844-how-does-the-technocracy-new-world-order-condition-enemy-mages?p=1409047#post1409047\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think the tecnocracy doesn't need torture to &amp;quot;brainwash&amp;quot; someone. Techniques of coercion, active interrogation and blackmail with some &amp;quot;enlightened psychology&amp;quot; (Mind Sphere) will easily do the work and even generates a kind of &amp;quot;Stockholm syndrome&amp;quot; depending on how long the victim has been kidnapped - it is as better to convince one to cooperate &amp;quot;spontaneously&amp;quot; than enforce the cooperation by torture and risk being betrayed. By the way, they could use microchips, microwaves and even &amp;quot;electroconvulsive therapy&amp;quot;. But, of course, a mage with powerful rotes of mind (optional entropy) can reverse and use this in them favor. However, the NWO is even more dangerous as they can use massive propaganda and &amp;quot;meme thing&amp;quot; (with Entropy) to do some large-scale brainwashing into a society and not only sleepers will be affected, mages and other supernatural creatures can succumb too.<br /> <br /> About &amp;quot;traditions doing brainwash&amp;quot;, probably Hermetic order use it guarantee their dominance over enemies - whether they are magicians or other supernatural creatures. Moreover, I can readly think of a hollow one using mind sphere to brainwash some regular tradition members, other &amp;quot;hollows&amp;quot; or even other supernatural being - like a captured vampire (ordinarily caitiffs or independents) or maybe ratkins[?] - to use as a personal bodyguard.</div> </div> </div> </div>That could be useful having a body guard you know won\u2019t betray you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-20T16:16:42-07:00","id":1409432,"title":"","content":"One shouldn't forget that there are Technocrats with a psychic Focus, some of whom no doubt probably do Conditioning.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1410-czernobog","name":"Czernobog","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-21T06:32:28-07:00","id":1409545,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Czernobog</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1406844-how-does-the-technocracy-new-world-order-condition-enemy-mages?p=1409432#post1409432\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One shouldn't forget that there are Technocrats with a psychic Focus, some of whom no doubt probably do Conditioning.</div> </div> </div> </div>The NWO focus sphere is mind, so the whole convention is in charge of implementing, policing and enforcement of conditioning.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-21T07:59:48-07:00","id":1409561,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_con